+=== V5  HIS-14's exit-13 refusal routed AROUND completeExecution again
+  [FAIL] exit 13 — HIS-14's unbindable-home refusal — emits a document too: a --json run that exits 13 says why, in JSON — got []: expected <1> but was <0>
